  "bio": "Assuéria is a highly skilled tattoo artist based in Campina Grande, Brazil, renowned for her delicate fineline and intricate floral designs that seem to weave stories across the skin. Her professionalism shines through in every interaction, ensuring each client receives a personalized experience that encapsulates her craftsmanship and dedication to the art of tattooing. Whether it's your first tattoo or an addition to your collection, Assuéria's precise touch and artistic vision will transform your ideas into living art.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Campina Grande, Paraiba, Brazil"
